{"seq":3,"slug":"forecast-bias-correct","title":"系统性偏差检测与修正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demand-forecast-replenishment/uncertainty/forecast-bias-correct","wordCount":3049,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"系统性偏差检测与修正\">系统性偏差检测与修正</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-偏差是可检测的系统性缺陷\">核心概念：偏差是可检测的系统性缺陷</h2><p>一个预测系统的准确度可以合格，同时始终偏在一个方向上。这不是绕口令：如果每周有 55% 的 SKU 高估 10%、45% 的 SKU 低估 10%，绝对值误差看起来正常，而合计的库存会持续上浮、资金持续被占用，同时局部又持续缺货。误差的<strong>大小</strong>与误差的<strong>方向</strong>是两个独立的问题，本文处理后者——如何把持续同向的误差从噪声里识别出来、如何归因到具体原因、以及如何修正而不掩盖问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"偏差与方差是两种病\">偏差与方差是两种病</h2><p>先建立分类。对一个预测系统，误差可以分解成三种成分：<strong>随机误差</strong>（不可预测的需求波动，无法消除）、<strong>方差问题</strong>（误差幅度大但无方向性，属于模型能力不足）、<strong>偏差问题</strong>（误差方向持续一致，属于系统性缺陷）。</p>\n<p>诊断的顺序与直觉相反：<strong>先查偏差，再查方差</strong>。理由有两点。第一，偏差的存在会污染方差估计——如果你用一个系统性高估的预测去计算误差标准差，得到的是围绕错误中心的离散度，据此定的安全库存会同时偏大且不对称。第二，偏差通常更容易修复：它往往来自流程、口径或参数，而不是来自模型表达力不足。</p>\n<p>偏差的标准度量是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Bias</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Bias} = \\frac{\\sum_t (\\hat{y}_t - y_t)}{\\sum_t y_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bias</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母用实际值之和而不是期数，使不同规模的序列可比。注意它的正负号约定（是「预测减实际」还是反过来）必须在团队内统一，并且要在指标定义里写清楚——这个看似琐碎的约定在很多团队里造成过反复的误读。</p>\n<p>偏差指标必须与准确度指标<strong>成对报告</strong>。只报准确度会漏掉偏差，只报偏差会漏掉方差。一个常见的错误是：团队为了改善「准确率」而引入平滑（例如把预测往历史均值拉），这确实降低了方差，却引入了负偏差——预测变得「更稳」，但持续低估，缺货率上升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"偏移动的检测方法\">偏移动的检测方法</h2><p>偏差是否「持续」需要统计判断，三种方法按灵敏度递增。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：跟踪信号（Tracking Signal）。</strong> 供应链领域最常用的方法，源自 Trigg 提出的预测系统监控机制（<em>Journal of the Operational Research Society</em>，1964，15(3):271-274，<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1057/jors.1964.48\">https://doi.org/10.1057/jors.1964.48</a> ），定义是累计偏差与平均绝对偏差之比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>TS</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mtext>MAD</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TS}_t = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{t} (y_i - \\hat{y}_i)}{\\text{MAD}_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4592em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6232em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9335em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 MAD 是平均绝对偏差的指数平滑值。工程上通常认为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>TS</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\text{TS}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TS</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 持续超过 4（经验阈值，源自三到四个标准差）就是偏差信号。它的优点是计算廉价、可对每条序列在线运行；缺点是阈值依赖分布假设，且对缓慢漂移的灵敏度有限。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：CUSUM 控制图。</strong> 累积和控制图由 Page 提出（<em>Biometrika</em>，1954，41(1/2):100-115，<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.2307/2333009\">https://doi.org/10.2307/2333009</a> ），对「小幅持续偏移」最灵敏，定义（单侧）为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_t^+ = \\max\\bigl(0,\\ C_{t-1}^+ + (y_t - \\hat{y}_t) - k\\bigr), \\qquad\nC_t^- = \\max\\bigl(0,\\ C_{t-1}^- - (y_t - \\hat{y}_t) - k\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0683em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3148em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3148em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是松弛量（通常取目标偏移量的一半），当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 时告警。CUSUM 的优势是它明确给出了「检测多大的偏移、平均多久检出」这两个可调参数（平均运行长度 ARL），使阈值设定有理论依据而不是靠感觉。</p>\n<p><strong>方法三：EWMA 控制图与滚动偏差。</strong> 指数加权的偏差序列（EWMA 控制图由 Roberts 提出，<em>Technometrics</em>，1959，1(3):239-250，<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080/00401706.1959.10489860\">https://doi.org/10.1080/00401706.1959.10489860</a> ），对偏移的灵敏度介于前两者之间。它的一个实用变体是<strong>按分桶的滚动偏差热力图</strong>：横轴是时间、纵轴是类目或价格带，颜色是偏差值，能在一次会议上直接看出「哪个类目从哪一周开始偏了」。</p>\n<p>三个方法要按用途组合使用：跟踪信号做全量在线初筛（每条序列都在算，成本低）、CUSUM 对已识别的重点序列做精确检测、EWMA 热力图做人工决策的输入。全量用 CUSUM 的成本通常不划算，而只用跟踪信号会漏掉缓慢漂移。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[预测版本 p_v] --&gt; B[回填实际值]&#10;  B --&gt; C[逐序列跟踪信号 TS]&#10;  C --&gt; D{跟踪信号绝对值超阈值}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[进入重点池]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[正常]&#10;  E --&gt; G[CUSUM 精确检测&lt;br/&gt;ARL 定阈值]&#10;  G --&gt; H{检出持续偏移}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[偏差归因]&#10;  I --&gt; J[真偏差: 修正]&#10;  I --&gt; K[假偏差: 口径/数据修复]&#10;  J --&gt; L[修正因子或流程变更]&#10;  L --&gt; M[记录 as-of 与原因]&#10;  M --&gt; N[下一轮评估验证]&#10;  K --&gt; N&#10;  F --&gt; O[EWMA 热力图&lt;br/&gt;人工审查]&#10;  O --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[预测版本 p_v] --&gt; B[回填实际值]\n  B --&gt; C[逐序列跟踪信号 TS]\n  C --&gt; D{跟踪信号绝对值超阈值}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[进入重点池]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[正常]\n  E --&gt; G[CUSUM 精确检测&lt;br/&gt;ARL 定阈值]\n  G --&gt; H{检出持续偏移}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[偏差归因]\n  I --&gt; J[真偏差: 修正]\n  I --&gt; K[假偏差: 口径/数据修复]\n  J --&gt; L[修正因子或流程变更]\n  L --&gt; M[记录 as-of 与原因]\n  M --&gt; N[下一轮评估验证]\n  K --&gt; N\n  F --&gt; O[EWMA 热力图&lt;br/&gt;人工审查]\n  O --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"偏差的六类常见成因\">偏差的六类常见成因</h2><p>识别出偏差之后，归因决定修正方式。跨境零售场景下最常见的六类成因，按出现频率排序：</p>\n<p><strong>成因一：人工干预的方向性。</strong> 运营倾向于「往上调」——因为缺货是显性事故（客户投诉、KPI 扣分），积压是隐性成本（体现在资金占用与季末清货，归因链条长）。于是大量 SKU 的预测被人为抬高，形成正偏差。诊断方式是计算「原始模型预测」与「调整后预测」的偏差对比：如果调整后的偏差显著大于原始，人工干预就是净负收益的。修正方式不是禁止干预，而是让干预留痕并纳入评估（见 <a href=\"../replenishment-decision/forecast-inventory-loop\">预测-库存-销售反馈闭环</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>成因二：口径错误。</strong> 预测的是「出库量」，评估时对比的是「下单量」或「签收量」；或者预测含退货而实际不含。这类偏差量级往往很大（数十个百分点）且方向固定，但它不是预测问题，任何模型改造都无效。诊断方式是对齐口径后重算——如果偏差消失，就是口径问题。</p>\n<p><strong>成因三：促销效应被误估。</strong> 促销的弹性被估得过高（原因见 <a href=\"../forecast-methods/seasonality-trend-event\">季节性/趋势/大促事件特征</a> 中关于共线性的讨论），于是每次促销都备多。特征是偏差集中出现在有促销的时段，非促销期正常。</p>\n<p><strong>成因四：新品先验偏乐观。</strong> 新品预测依赖相似品先验，而相似品的选择往往偏向成功商品（因为成功商品的属性组合更容易被匹配到），导致先验系统性偏乐观。诊断方式是单独看「上架 0 到 8 周」桶的偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>成因五：结构变化未及时反映。</strong> 渠道转移（用户从网页转 App 导致归因窗口变化）、竞品进入、政策变化（如某国调整进口税使需求骤降）。这类偏差表现为一个明确的时间点之后持续偏移，用 CUSUM 最容易检出。</p>\n<p><strong>成因六：库存约束造成的假偏差。</strong> 断货期实际销量为零，如果评估时把它们算进去，会产生巨大的负偏差，而这个负偏差是供给造成的不是预测造成的。<strong>必须在评估前对断货期做掩码</strong>，否则系统会「学习」到需求很低，并在下一轮补货时更少下货。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成因</th>\n<th>诊断特征</th>\n<th>修正方式</th>\n<th>是否需要改模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人工干预方向性</td>\n<td>调整后偏差 &gt; 原始偏差</td>\n<td>干预留痕 + 干预者级偏差检测</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>口径错误</td>\n<td>偏差量级大且固定</td>\n<td>对齐口径重算</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>促销效应误估</td>\n<td>偏差集中在促销期</td>\n<td>补共变量、分离季节与促销</td>\n<td>是（特征）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新品先验偏乐观</td>\n<td>偏差集中在新品桶</td>\n<td>修正相似品选择的采样偏倚</td>\n<td>是（先验）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构变化</td>\n<td>CUSUM 在某时点后持续偏移</td>\n<td>加协变量或做分段/加漂移项</td>\n<td>是（结构）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存约束假偏差</td>\n<td>负偏差与断货时段重合</td>\n<td>掩码断货期</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"修正的四种手段与它们的风险\">修正的四种手段与它们的风险</h2><p>归因之后是修正。四种手段按「侵入性」递增，也按风险递增。</p>\n<p><strong>手段一是乘法修正因子。</strong> 对一条序列或一个分组，把预测乘上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>bias</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1 - \\text{bias})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bias</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。实现最简单、立即生效。风险是它会<strong>掩盖问题的根因</strong>：如果偏差来自口径错误，加因子只是让数字对上，下一次口径变化时因子会失效并造成新的错误。使用规则是：只在确认偏差是「真偏差」且短期内无法修复根因时使用，并设置到期复审。</p>\n<p><strong>手段二是分位数/分布层面的修正。</strong> 如果偏差来自分布假设（例如用高斯假设处理重尾需求，导致均值位置合理但尾部太窄），应在分布层面修正而不是对均值加因子。做法包括：改用负二项/Tweedie 类分布、对残差做经验分布重采样、或用保序回归修正分位数交叉。</p>\n<p><strong>手段三是特征与结构的修正。</strong> 针对促销共线、结构变化这类成因，正确做法是补特征或改结构（如引入变点、加市场级协变量），而不是加事后因子。成本最高但能根治。</p>\n<p><strong>手段四是流程修正。</strong> 针对人工干预与口径这类成因，修正发生在流程与数据治理层，而不是模型层。这通常是最见效、也最容易被技术团队忽略的一类。</p>\n<p>一个重要的方法论提醒：<strong>修正必须有 as-of 语义并留痕</strong>。如果系统在 2026 年 6 月发现某序列从 3 月起有正偏差并施加了修正因子，那么 3 月的预测不应被追溯修改，否则历史评估永远无法复现「当时交付了什么」。正确做法是把修正作为新版本从生效日开始应用，并记录「修正对象、生效起点、依据的检测窗口、归因结论」。这一条与第三章第二节的「模型准确度 vs 交付准确度」是同一套纪律的两个侧面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从检测到闭环的三个节奏\">从检测到闭环的三个节奏</h2><p>偏差管理不是一个一次性任务，它有三个不同频率的节奏，各自处理不同尺度的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>日/周节奏（快回路）</strong>：跑跟踪信号，全量初筛，对越界序列输出告警；由系统或值班人员做初步判断（真偏差 vs 数据问题）。这个环节的关键是<strong>误报率要低</strong>，否则告警会被忽略。分层设阈值是控制误报的主要手段。</p>\n<p><strong>月节奏（中回路）</strong>：做分桶的偏差分析（按类目、价格带、上架时长、促销状态），识别<strong>群体性偏差</strong>。群体性偏差比单序列偏差重要得多，因为它一定是系统性的：如果整个「新品 0 到 8 周」桶正偏差 15%，那就不是偶然。</p>\n<p><strong>季节奏（慢回路）</strong>：把偏差归因的结论反哺到模型与流程：更新先验、补特征、改口径、调整干预政策。这是第四章第三节所讲的闭环在「预测侧」的落点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[快回路: 周] --&gt; B[跟踪信号全量初筛]&#10;  B --&gt; C[单序列告警 + 初判]&#10;  C --&gt; D[中回路: 月]&#10;  D --&gt; E[分桶群体性偏差分析]&#10;  E --&gt; F[归因到六类成因]&#10;  F --&gt; G[慢回路: 季]&#10;  G --&gt; H[改先验/补特征/改口径/调政策]&#10;  H --&gt; I[下一版本评估验证]&#10;  I --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[快回路: 周] --&gt; B[跟踪信号全量初筛]\n  B --&gt; C[单序列告警 + 初判]\n  C --&gt; D[中回路: 月]\n  D --&gt; E[分桶群体性偏差分析]\n  E --&gt; F[归因到六类成因]\n  F --&gt; G[慢回路: 季]\n  G --&gt; H[改先验/补特征/改口径/调政策]\n  H --&gt; I[下一版本评估验证]\n  I --&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>偏差（方向）与方差（幅度）是独立的两种病，诊断顺序是先查偏差再查方差，因为偏差会污染方差估计。</li>\n<li>跟踪信号适合全量在线初筛，CUSUM 对缓慢漂移最灵敏且阈值可用 ARL 理论化，EWMA 热力图适合人工决策输入；三者应组合而非择一。</li>\n<li>六类常见成因中，人工干预方向性、口径错误、库存约束造成的假偏差这三类不需要改模型，改流程与数据即可。</li>\n<li>断货期必须在评估前掩码，否则会产生巨大负偏差并被系统当成「需求低」学习。</li>\n<li>修正手段按侵入性排序：乘法因子 → 分布层面 → 特征/结构 → 流程；乘法因子最容易掩盖根因，必须配到期复审。</li>\n<li>修正必须有 as-of 语义：历史预测不可追溯修改，修正作为新版本从生效日应用并留痕。</li>\n<li>偏差管理有三个节奏：周（单序列）、月（群体性）、季（反哺模型与流程），群体性偏差是最高价值信号。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"系统性偏差检测与修正","id":"系统性偏差检测与修正"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：偏差是可检测的系统性缺陷","id":"核心概念-偏差是可检测的系统性缺陷"},{"level":2,"text":"偏差与方差是两种病","id":"偏差与方差是两种病"},{"level":2,"text":"偏移动的检测方法","id":"偏移动的检测方法"},{"level":2,"text":"偏差的六类常见成因","id":"偏差的六类常见成因"},{"level":2,"text":"修正的四种手段与它们的风险","id":"修正的四种手段与它们的风险"},{"level":2,"text":"从检测到闭环的三个节奏","id":"从检测到闭环的三个节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预测准确度度量与偏差监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demand-forecast-replenishment/uncertainty/forecast-accuracy-metric"},"next":{"title":"补货点/补货量计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demand-forecast-replenishment/replenishment-decision/reorder-point-quantity"}}